<title>POLAND: Ocean to issue five million rights.</title>
<headline>Ocean to issue five million rights.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Polish wholesaler and retailer Ocean SA will vote on August 29 on whether to issue nearly five million new shares in a one-for-two rights issue at three zlotys each, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Management would be able to give a final issue price by two weeks before the start of the subscription.</p>
<p>Ocean currently has 9.98 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
